  'Statistics Canada, Consumer Price Index, September 2026, released October 19, 2026, via The Canadian Press, Wealth Professional and Canadian Mortgage Professional; Bank of Canada, Canadian Survey of Consumer Expectations and Business Outlook Survey, third quarter 2026, via InvestingLive and CTV News; Statistics Canada, Labour Force Survey, September 2026; Bloomberg data via the Financial Post, October 19, 2026; Tversky and Kahneman, Availability: A Heuristic for Judging Frequency and Probability, Cognitive Psychology, 1973; D’Acunto, Malmendier, Ospina and Weber, Exposure to Grocery Prices and Inflation Expectations, Journal of Political Economy, 2021; Malmendier and Nagel, Learning from Inflation Experiences, Quarterly Journal of Economics, 2016.'
);
